# Cloudflare Pages custom headers — applied to every response.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# Content-Security-Policy notes:
# - style-src needs 'unsafe-inline' for one inline style= attribute on the homepage
#   hero (src/pages/index.astro).
# - script-src has NO 'unsafe-inline' — instead it allowlists exact sha256 hashes of
#   the site's inline scripts (verified against the real `npm run build` output in
#   dist/, across every page, not just the homepage):
#     NB/bDmdC... = Navbar.astro's mobile-menu/dropdown/accordion script (author-written, all pages)
#     QzWFZi+F... = Astro's client:load hydration bootstrap (ContactForm/FeedbackForm)
#     Ya0pUYrC... = Astro's island props/hydration runtime (contact, feedback)
#     frISRX4G... = RenewalHelper.astro renewal-timing helper (author-written, /utilities)
#   The 2 Astro-generated hashes are framework runtime code and WILL change if the
#   astro/vite version changes, or if hydration directives (client:load/visible/idle)
#   are added/removed/moved between pages — rebuild and recompute if inline scripts
#   start getting blocked again. To regenerate: build the site, then for each unique
#   inline <script>...</script> body (exact text, no trimming) across every dist/**/*.html
#   file, compute base64(sha256(body)) and prefix with 'sha256-'.
# - Cloudflare Turnstile (spam protection on ContactForm.tsx / FeedbackForm.tsx) needs
#   its script, iframe and verification XHR allowlisted: script-src, frame-src and
#   connect-src all include https://challenges.cloudflare.com.
# - Cloudflare Web Analytics (cookieless; enabled in the Pages dashboard, which injects
#   the beacon): script-src allows https://static.cloudflareinsights.com and connect-src
#   allows https://cloudflareinsights.com, where the beacon reports.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security: tells browsers to only ever use HTTPS for this domain for a
# year. Deliberately no includeSubDomains/preload — both are hard to undo, and
# includeSubDomains would force HTTPS on every subdomain you might ever add.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-NB/bDmdCHo5gX3bYjEyMPVsT9i3B9u5hMjf7uX/hI5c=' 'sha256-QzWFZi+FLIx23tnm9SBU4aEgx4x8DsuASP07mfqol/c=' 'sha256-Ya0pUYrC7nM5Cn/056TyVuEiz6dFGrzmkWzgON0pF0U=' 'sha256-frISRX4G0JXUYFtQVGbhMxSy22cp+08FW/11kYXz3Y8=' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.web3forms.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://cloudflareinsights.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; form-action 'self' https://api.web3forms.com; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'

# Certificate PDFs: keep them out of search results as standalone documents (visitors can
# still open them from the site's links). Listed explicitly rather than with a wildcard.
/dro-cert.pdf
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

# Hashed build assets (JS, CSS, fonts): their filenames change whenever their content
# does, so they can be cached for a year without ever serving a stale copy. (Unhashed
# files like the hero photos keep Cloudflare's default short cache.)
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
